ClaimReward_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given no pending reward
│  ├── when caller never staked
│  │  └── it should revert
│  └── when caller is the only staker
│     └── it should revert
└── given pending reward
   ├── given paused
   │  └── it should still pay the reward
   └── given not paused
      └── it should pay the reward
         ├── it should transfer the reward to the staker
         ├── it should leave the staked amount unchanged
         ├── it should move the staker to the current round
         ├── it should leave the other stakers' rewards unchanged
         └── it should emit {ClaimReward} event
